h` prints its usage instead of running, because the console cannot build the container either. Recovery is copying the original files back (from the extension's repository, `git show <installed ref>:<file>`, or from the released package of the installed version) and flushing again. Deploy such a change the regular way: merge it, `composer update <package>` on the instance, then `typo3 extension:setup` and `typo3 cache:flush`. `extension:setup` boots the full container, so a broken definition fails there instead of in the frontend. Prove the change before the merge with the extension's test suite, not on the instance.\n\n**Running composer when the runtime image has none.** Use a build image with composer and git against the same app volume, run as root with the entrypoint overridden when the image's entrypoint drops to the web user:\n\n```bash\ndocker run --rm -u 0 --entrypoint composer \\","confidence":0.8,"evidence":{},"finding":"run as root","finding_ids":["finding-9bf76d2f556646e19f0f1bc20402373a"],"id":"sha256:6b90f0308d92e4ef511ba6c08f247886c4f9fdb285e85321948025bfe87d33a6","intent":null,"line":48,"match_fingerprint":"1cfe84ad238a83b6b7b002f0cf3adcd0ed383f2482b1b6e3a518efc19eb1d2c0","message":"Commands invoke sudo or root privileges. Verify this elevated access is necessary and justified.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-9bf76d2f556646e19f0f1bc20402373a","line":48,"path":"references/v13-to-v14-project-upgrade.md","start_column":123}],"path":"references/v13-to-v14-project-upgrade.md","pattern":"Sudo/Root Execution","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Avoid sudo/root unless strictly required. Prefer least-privilege patterns. If elevation is needed, document the justification and scope.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"PE2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":123,"tags":["Privilege Escalation","contextual-triage","likely-benign-context"]},{"category":"MCP Rug Pull","code_snippet":null,"confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":null,"finding_ids":["finding-ffc17